OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a largely cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith showery rain, but some bright
OL,7,Fspells in the east. Light winds at
OL,8,Ffirst but westerly winds will pick up,
OL,9,Fespecially in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy and windy evening
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain. Becoming
OL,13,Fmostly dry overnight with winds easing
OL,14,Fdown but a few showers continuing in
OL,15,Fthe southwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,18,Fwith bright spells developing. The odd
OL,19,Fshower around, mainly in the southwest
OL,20,Fin the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
